{"date":null,"platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/2b/3a/25587_7mIuZ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/2b/3a/25587_7mIuZ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/2b/3a/25587_7mIuZ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/2b/3a/25587_7mIuZ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/2b/3a/25587_7mIuZ.jpg"},"summary":"　皇太子在一次民间出巡，邂逅了一位民间女子。这位女子为皇太子诞下一名女儿。适逢盗贼作乱，皇太子与母女俩失散。数年后，皇太子已登基成为皇上，并寻回失散的女儿──甜丝丝。丝丝在民间流落多年，沾染了民间的市井习气，加上生性懒散，皇上为之头疼。皇上为了让丝丝成为一个高贵的格格，于是把她送进尚书房学习。甜丝丝格格那顽皮、爱捣蛋的可爱性格为皇宫带来了新冲击，故事亦由此而起。\r\n　　此后，甜丝丝认识了尚书房班长心柔柔、从西洋归来的华伦，以及后备武状元白米饭。这四位好友与讨厌小朋友的大臣王坤，在皇宫发生连串趣事。 ","name":"甜心格格","name_cn":"甜心格格","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":264,"total_count":159886},{"name":"童年","count":140,"total_count":92577},{"name":"百合","count":121,"total_count":398675},{"name":"萌","count":113,"total_count":71099},{"name":"TV","count":106,"total_count":1391521},{"name":"搞笑","count":85,"total_count":632950},{"name":"2011","count":76,"total_count":52658},{"name":"原创","count":74,"total_count":614469},{"name":"日常","count":71,"total_count":395896},{"name":"幼女向","count":50,"total_count":1939},{"name":"方块动漫","count":45,"total_count":110},{"name":"穿越","count":34,"total_count":62285},{"name":"腹黑vs天然","count":30,"total_count":30},{"name":"中国","count":27,"total_count":31157},{"name":"2011年10月","count":21,"total_count":16495},{"name":"国产动画","count":10,"total_count":5616},{"name":"子供向","count":8,"total_count":12579},{"name":"治愈","count":6,"total_count":299730},{"name":"补标","count":3,"total_count":2862},{"name":"甜心格格","count":3,"total_count":13},{"name":"国漫","count":2,"total_count":15581},{"name":"中国动画","count":2,"total_count":2103},{"name":"童年回忆","count":2,"total_count":1060},{"name":"方块动漫画","count":2,"total_count":12},{"name":"国创","count":2,"total_count":4165},{"name":"喜剧","count":2,"total_count":34187},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35478},{"name":"2010-2019","count":1,"total_count":2170},{"name":"年番","count":1,"total_cou